{"id":"4ff9b90c9fb9c1d5","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-completeness-theorem.md","title":"GL Completeness Theorem","display":"df-gl-completeness-theorem — GL Completeness Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-completeness-theorem","aliases":["89-df-gl-completeness-theorem"],"display":"df-gl-completeness-theorem — GL Completeness Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-validity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-completeness-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-completeness-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-completeness-theorem — GL Completeness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50df0572bbd651eb\" href=\"?note=50df0572bbd651eb\" title=\"89-df-gl-validity\">89-df-gl-validity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50df0572bbd651eb\" href=\"?note=50df0572bbd651eb\" title=\"89-df-gl-validity\">89-df-gl-validity</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是下述定义的完备性性质缩写，其环境固定为上述 GL 公式集及有效公式集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL完全性定理保证 GL 的语义完备性</li>\n<li>GL完全性定理是 GL 的基本定理</li>\n<li>GL完全性定理是 Solovay 定理的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-validity","status":"resolved","id":"50df0572bbd651eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is from [[89-df-gl-logic]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-validity","status":"resolved","id":"50df0572bbd651eb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is from\n[[89-df-gl-validity]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true}],"bytes":991,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-completeness-theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","50df0572bbd651eb"]}